{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/931647-new-supernatural-fighting-style-ideas","id":931647,"title":"New supernatural fighting style ideas?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-14T15:40:02-07:00","id":931647,"title":"New supernatural fighting style ideas?","content":"The updated ChroD fighting styles are really interesting, and I was wondering if anyone had ideas for any more, based on supernatural merits, designed for specific splats, etc. For example, I think some sort of &quot;High Speed Fighting&quot; style merit could work for characters with supernaturally enhanced speed of some kind. I thought of vampires with Celerity when I came up with it, but I think as a merit it would be open to anyone with a sufficient level of speed (it wouldn't have to be their base speed, just the maximum level of speed they can buff themselves to with their powers, though the merit could only be used when said power is active).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-24T11:50:47-07:00","id":936637,"title":"","content":"The Adamantine Hand from mage the awakening 1st edition is pretty good. you can also look into the armory hacks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4340-warpwind","name":"Warpwind","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4340_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":